# The strip under the status panel (StatusWin_draw_status, see statuswin.c): the icons of the base and of the units stacked on the
# square, as many as fit, with the arrows that show when there are more, and the arrow functions that move the pick up and down the
# stack. A base (of the player's faction, size 3; the game has four already, so it is base 4) and a stack of three units (ids 6 to 8) are made on the first unit's square.
# `next` word at 0x9529f8 is cut to make a stack of three) are made on the first unit's square. The picked unit is the panel's
# sel_veh (0x8c6b24), the picked base its sel_base (0x8c6b28); unit 6 is at 0x952960 (+4 state, +0xc faction in the high half, +0x10
# damage and order).
